  "originalText": "[Codename] Breeze\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] 1 year\n[Place of Birth] Victoria\n[Date of Birth] June 24\n[Race] Vulpo\n[Height] 162cm\n[Originium Infection Condition] \nInfection confirmed by medical examination.",
